  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "f3d-nvs-benchmark",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tF3D NVS Benchmark\n\t\n\nEvaluation results for 9 Novel View Synthesis (NVS) methods across 3 benchmarks, stored as NPZ files containing predicted and ground-truth RGB images with camera parameters.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tModels\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nModel\nType\nReference\n\n\n\t\t\nDA3RAE\nFeature-space diffusion (DA3 backbone)\nOurs\n\n\nDA3RAE-DINO\nFeature-space diffusion (DINO backbone)\nOurs (ablation)\n\n\nDA3RAE-VAE\nFeature-space diffusion (VAE backbone)\nOurs (ablation)\n\n\nVGGT\nFeature-space diffusion (VGGT backbone)\nOurs\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SeonghuJeon/f3d-nvs-benchmark.",
